// Title: File Create Exe Temp
// Description: Hunts for file create exe temp
// MITRE ATT&CK: T1105, T1036
// Severity: informational
// FalsePositives:
//   - Software install/update yang sah membuat file di path tersebut.
FileCreationEvents | where FolderPath contains 'AppData\\Local\\Temp' and FileName endswith '.exe'
